ner\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"}}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why hire an interior designer for office space in Hauz Khas?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Many Hauz Khas offices are in converted buildings or upper floors with odd layouts. A designer makes the most of the space while keeping it comfortable for the team.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you design creative studios and agencies?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Studios need open work areas, quiet corners, display walls and good natural light, and we plan the space around how your team collaborates.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do you handle wiring and networking?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Power, data and lighting points are planned with the furniture layout, so cables stay hidden and workstations can be moved later if needed.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does an interior designer for office projects deliver?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Layouts, 3D views, furniture and finish selections, drawings for contractors and site supervision until the office is ready to use.\"}}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Interior Designer for Office in Hauz Khas, Delhi\",\"serviceType\":\"Interior Designer for Office\",\"description\":\"Need an interior designer for office in Hauz Khas? 9th Corner designs workstations, cabins, meeting rooms and receptions that suit your team.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/hauzkhas/services-interior-designer-for-office\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Hauz Khas, Delhi\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"<!-- CITY-EXPANSION -->\n    <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        b, strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/e1.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card.full-width,\n        .service-card:nth-child(3),\n        .service-card:nth-child(4) {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .service-card p {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .service-card p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n        .service-card ul {\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        .service-card li {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Why Choose Us --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro p {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            list-style: none;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 15px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list strong {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 14px 38px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.3);\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(74, 67, 58, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .closing-section p a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }        /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Interior Designer for Office in Hauz Khas, Delhi</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Workspaces for Hauz Khas Startups and Studios</h2>\n            <p>As an interior designer for office spaces in Hauz Khas, Delhi, we design offices that enhance operational efficiency, embody your brand values, and prioritize employee comfort. From high-stakes corporate headquarters to creative co-working spaces, we create professional, functional, and visually compelling work environments that foster collaboration and excellence.</p>\n            <p>From architecture studios and agencies in Hauz Khas Village to clinics and consultancies around Green Park, offices here need to do a lot with limited space. As an interior designer for office projects, we plan for focus, meetings, storage and a reception that makes a good first impression.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Smart and Functional Office Interiors</h2>\n            <p>\"Our approach focuses on high-performance ergonomic layouts, modern modular furniture, and smart lighting systems. Each office we design is a tailored ecosystem built to improve workflow, nurture creativity, and leave a lasting professional impression on both clients and employees.\"</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Small Offices and Studios</h3>\n                <p>Many offices here sit in converted homes or upper floors of market buildings. We work with existing walls where we can, add glass partitions to share light and plan desks so nobody sits with their back to a door.</p><p>Acoustic panels and soft furnishings stop calls from carrying across a small room.</p><p>Phone booths and a small huddle room give people somewhere to take calls without leaving the floor.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Larger Corporate Floors</h3>\n                <p>For bigger teams, an interior designer for office floors has to balance open desks, cabins, meeting rooms, a pantry and quiet zones. We plan cabling, server space and power backup early, so the office runs smoothly from the first day.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>What a Productive Office Needs</h3>\n                <p>Good daylight and glare-free task lighting. Chairs and desk heights that suit long hours. Enough meeting space, from two-person booths to a board room. Storage for files and personal items. A pantry people actually use. Branding at the reception and key walls so clients know where they are.</p><p>Cooling is often the biggest complaint in small offices. We place AC units and return air so no desk sits under a cold draft or in a warm corner.</p><p><b>Productivity Layouts:</b> Strategic spatial planning that balances open collaboration areas with \"deep work\" zones to minimize distractions and optimize output.</p><p><b>Ergonomic Wellness:</b> Integrating adjustable furniture and circadian lighting systems that reduce physical strain and keep teams energized throughout the workday.</p><p><b>Brand Identity Design:</b> Infusing your office with bespoke architectural elements and color palettes that physically manifest your brand’s mission and culture.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>From Brief to Move-In</h3>\n                <p>We study your team size, growth plans and working style. Our interior designer for office projects then prepares the layout, furniture plan and 3D views for approval.</p><p>The site team handles partitions, false ceilings, electrical and data cabling, HVAC coordination, furniture and finishing, planned so your team can move in on the agreed date.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Why Choose Us as Your Interior Designer for Office Spaces?</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>Office projects often run while the business is still working. Where needed, we schedule noisy work after hours and keep the site sealed off from staff areas. Furniture deliveries can be timed for weekends when that helps.</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Specialized in High-Performance Corporate & Commercial Interiors</strong>\n                    Offices, clinics and studios of many sizes.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Customized Solutions for Hybrid & Modern Workspace Needs</strong>\n                    Layouts that work for hybrid teams and daily meetings.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>End-to-End Project Management from Blueprints to Handover</strong>\n                    One team from drawing board to move-in day.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Cabling and Power Planned Early</strong>\n                    No messy wires or tripping circuits later.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Room to Grow</strong>\n                    Layouts that can take more desks without a rebuild.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"final-cta-message\">\n                <p>Ready to redefine your work culture? Partner with Hauz Khas's leading interior designer for office projects to build a workspace that works for you.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects Near Hauz Khas</h2>\n                <p>Interior projects by 9th Corner in Green Park, Saket and South Extension, near Hauz Khas.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                    <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-alok-verma-south-x/mr-alok-verma-south-x/74.avif\" alt=\"Home interior by 9th Corner in South Extension, Delhi\" title=\"South Extension Home\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-sachin-saket/mr-sachin-saket/26.avif\" alt=\"Interior design by 9th Corner in Saket, Delhi\" title=\"Saket Home Interi