                <p class=\"faq-a\">Layouts, 3D views, furniture and finish selections, drawings for contractors and site supervision until the office is ready to use.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>An Office Your Team Enjoys Coming To</h2>\n            <p>People do better work in a space that is comfortable and well planned. A good interior designer for office spaces keeps that in mind at every step. Small choices, like where the printer sits or how loud the pantry is, add up over a year.</p><p>Setting up or redoing an office in Hauz Khas? <a href=\"/hauzkhas/contact\">Contact 9th Corner</a> today.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}